---
// The terms of use text. English is the governing version; the German text is
// a courtesy translation shown on /de/terms/ and says so in the page intro.
// Keep the clause numbering identical in both languages.
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import type { Lang } from '@/data/i18n';

interface Props {
  lang?: Lang;
}

const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const prefix = lang === 'de' ? '/de' : '';
---

{
  lang === 'en' ? (
    <div class="prose-m">
      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by {site.legalName} (UEN {site.uen}), a company incorporated in
        Singapore with its registered office at {site.registeredAddress} (Meridium, we, us or our).
      </p>

      <h2>2. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
      <p>
        By using this website you agree to these terms of use. If you do not agree with them,
        please do not use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Information, not advice</h2>
      <p>
        The content of this website is general information about Meridium and about doing
        business in Singapore and the region. It is not legal, tax, accounting or investment
        advice, and it does not take account of your circumstances. Nothing on this site creates
        an adviser and client relationship. Professional services are provided only under a
        written engagement agreed with us, and you should not act on anything you read here
        without advice on your own situation.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Free resources and tools</h2>
      <p>
        We make certain resources available free of charge, including the setup planner, the income tax calculator,
        the Employment Pass salary calculator and the compliance calendar on our <a href={`${prefix}/resources/`}>resources page</a>{' '}
        (together, the tools). The tools are provided for general information and planning
        purposes only and are not part of any professional service.
      </p>
      <p>
        The income tax calculator produces an estimate. It applies published rates, reliefs and thresholds
        as at the verification date shown on the page, uses simplified assumptions that are
        described on the page, and does not account for every relief, deduction, rebate or
        special scheme that may apply to you. Rates and reliefs change, usually following the
        annual Singapore Budget, and we may not have updated the tools at the time you use them.
        Your actual tax liability is determined solely by the Inland Revenue Authority of
        Singapore (IRAS) on assessment. The tools are not provided, reviewed or endorsed by IRAS
        or any other authority; references to IRAS are source attributions only.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Employment Pass salary calculator applies the qualifying salaries and COMPASS C1
        salary benchmarks published by the Ministry of Manpower (MOM) as at the verification
        date shown on the page. It covers only the salary requirements. It does not assess the
        other COMPASS criteria, bonus points or any other factor MOM considers, and MOM updates
        its salary requirements from time to time. Whether an Employment Pass is granted is
        decided solely by MOM. The calculator is not provided, reviewed or endorsed by MOM or
        any other authority; references to MOM are source attributions only.
      </p>
      <p>
        The setup planner gives general guidance on structure, timing, government fees and tax,
        based on the answers you give and on rules and fees as at the verification date shown
        on the page. Timelines are typical allowances, not commitments, and do not reflect the
        processing times of any authority or bank. The planner does not cover every scheme,
        licence or exception. Whether a pass, licence or registration is granted is decided
        solely by the authority concerned, and the planner is not provided, reviewed or endorsed
        by any authority; references to authorities are source attributions only.
      </p>
      <p>
        Using the tools does not create an adviser and client relationship, and no output of the
        tools constitutes advice on your position. You are responsible for verifying any result
        before relying on it, and Meridium accepts no liability for any decision taken, tax
        provision made, filing submitted or work pass application made on the basis of the
        tools. If you need a figure you
        can rely on, engage us in writing.
      </p>
      <p>
        The calculators run entirely in your browser. Figures you enter are not transmitted to
        or stored by Meridium. The setup planner also runs in your browser; your answers reach
        Meridium only if you choose to send them through the review form at the end of your plan.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Accuracy and changes</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable care to keep the content of this site accurate and current, including
        references to Singapore regulatory requirements, which change from time to time. We do
        not warrant that the content is complete, accurate or up to date at any given moment,
        and we may change or remove content, including the tools, without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The content of this website, including text, the tools, the Meridium name, the orchid
        mark and the site design, belongs to Meridium or its licensors. You may view, download
        and print content for your own reference, but you may not reproduce it commercially,
        embed or redistribute the tools, or present any of it as your own without our written
        permission. Statutory rates, thresholds and salary benchmarks reproduced in the tools are
        public information of the Government of Singapore.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to misuse this website: not to attempt unauthorised access, not to
        interfere with its operation, not to use it to transmit malicious code, and not to use
        any content harvesting or scraping tools against it.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third party sites</h2>
      <p>
        Where this site links to third party websites, including government resources and pages
        hosted for us on resources.meridium.sg, those links are provided for convenience. We are
        not responsible for the content of third party sites.
      </p>

